  "steps": [
    "To a pot of 1 ltr boiling water add 1 tsp salt, 1 tsp sugar, ½ tbsp ginger garlic paste, 80g soya chunks.",
    "Let it boil for 5 min and then squeeze the water out.",
    "Now take a bowl add 3 tbsp Greek yogurt, 2 tbsp fresh cream, 1 cheese cube, grated (I used 30gm mozeralla cheese), 1 tbsp oregano, 1 tbsp black pepper, 2 tsp red chilli powder, ½ tbsp maida or corn flour, 1/2 tsp salt.",
    "Mix it well and coat the soya chunks.",
    "Then pop them onto skewers and airfry at 180 degrees for 18 min.",
    "Meanwhile let’s make the sauce, to a pan on medium head add 1 1/2 tsp Butter, 10-12 garlic cloves, minced, 1/2 tsp Chilli flakes, 1 tsp maida, 150ml Water, 3 tbsp fresh cream, 1/4 tsp salt, 1 tbsp honey, 1/2 handful Fresh coriander, chopped.",
    "Mix it all well.",
    "And drizzle it alll over the air fried skewers and your Butter Garlic Soya Skewers are ready."
  ],
